INTERPRETATION
The verifier constructs N_d^b, 1<=b<=4, by direct finite-fusion
recurrence.  Independently, it classically decomposes V_d^(tensor b),
affine-folds every summand with its sign, groups the retained summands
into maximal fusion intervals, and evaluates only their telescoped
weight-multiplicity endpoints.  The recurrence comparison is bounded;
the affine-fold and telescoping proof in Lemma 5A8H28O is unbounded.

